<title>SPAIN: Spain Montoro-EU summit aims to perfect EMU deal.</title>
<headline>Spain Montoro-EU summit aims to perfect EMU deal.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Economy Secretary Cristobal Montoro said on Monday the Amsterdam European Union summit was not aimed at revising the Maastricht Treaty, but perfecting it.</p>
<p>&quot;It's not time to revise the agreement but to perfect it,&quot; he told a seminar on Europe's single currency plan.</p>
<p>He said the summit would be a decisive step towards the single European currency.</p>
<p>&quot;I am convinced that the Amsterdam summit is a decisive and irreversible step for monetary union&quot;</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
